	(text "Note:  1)  Connections are standard 2.54mm pitch Pin Headers.  Pin Sockets\n       can be used in lieu of Pin Headers; dependent on what is\n       attached to the Arduino Mega.\n\n       2)  5x - 1x08 Pin Headers\n            1x - 1x10 Pin Header\n            1x - 2x18 Pin Header\n     "
